chinese></item><item><text>Embiyax</text><chinese>大力</chinese></item><item><text>embiyax</text><chinese>強烈</chinese></item><count>9</count></custom><song><count>0</count></song><picture><count>0</count></picture><read><item><text>embiyax</text><chinese>力量；平安</chinese><lesson>13</lesson><type>word</type><order>2</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/extension/rd_practice/index.php?d=33&amp;l=13&amp;view=vocabulary&amp;w=2</url></item><item><text>Umin: Embiyax su. Bsiyaq ta bi ini tqita da, ma su saw smdamat wah! Maah tru jiyax do kika jiyax pncingan Yisu.</text><chinese>明兄： 平安。 好久不見了，非常想念。再過3天就是聖誕節了，</chinese><lesson>3</lesson><type>sentence</type><order>1</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/extension/rd_practice/index.php?d=33&amp;l=3&amp;view=article</url></item><item><text>Embiyax namu kana hug!</text><chinese>大家好！</chinese><lesson>13</lesson><type>sentence</type><order>1</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/extension/rd_practice/index.php?d=33&amp;l=13&amp;view=article</url></item><item><text>embiyax ku bi siida o mniq ku Taywang,</text><chinese>我最好的年月是在臺灣島上度過的，</chinese><lesson>26</lesson><type>sentence</type><order>2</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/extension/rd_practice/index.php?d=33&amp;l=26&amp;view=article</url></item><count>4</count></read><culture><count>0</count></culture><dialogue><item><text>Embiyax namu kana? prajing ta da!</text><chinese>大家好。我們開始了。</chinese><lesson>1</lesson><season>1</season><order>1</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=1&amp;season=1</url></item><item><text>Embiyax su, mtgsa!</text><chinese>B:老師好。</chinese><lesson>1</lesson><season>1</season><order>3</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=1&amp;season=1</url></item><item><text>Embiyax namu kana? emptgsa ku quri uqun Truku ka sayang.</text><chinese>大家好。今天老師要教大家食物的太魯閣語怎麼說。</chinese><lesson>1</lesson><season>1</season><order>5</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=1&amp;season=1</url></item><item><text>Embiyax su uri hug?</text><chinese>A:你還好嗎?</chinese><lesson>4</lesson><season>1</season><order>29</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=4&amp;season=1</url></item><item><text>Embiyax su uri hug?</text><chinese>A:你還好嗎?</chinese><lesson>4</lesson><season>1</season><order>31</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=4&amp;season=1</url></item><item><text>Embiyax namu kana, Madas ku munan sayang mha ta qmita alang rudan.</text><chinese>A:大家好，老師今天要帶大家去部落訪問耆老。</chinese><lesson>7</lesson><season>1</season><order>1</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=7&amp;season=1</url></item><item><text>Embiyax namu kana, madas ku munan mha ta qmita hnmaan masu hiya.</text><chinese>A:大家好，老師今天要帶大家去小米田。</chinese><lesson>7</lesson><season>1</season><order>7</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=7&amp;season=1</url></item><item><text>Embiyax namu kana, mha ta tbgan klgan mneuedus ka sayang.</text><chinese>A:大家好，我們今天要去動物園。</chinese><lesson>7</lesson><season>1</season><order>17</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=7&amp;season=1</url></item><item><text>Iq wa, embiyax ku siida o musa ku tmsmat dgiyaq kdjiyax ka yaku.</text><chinese>B:好的。我年輕的時候很常上山打獵。</chinese><lesson>9</lesson><season>1</season><order>24</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=9&amp;season=1</url></item><item><text>Embiyax su,embarig su manu?</text><chinese>A:你好，你要買什麼?</chinese><lesson>10</lesson><season>1</season><order>1</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=10&amp;season=1</url></item><item><text>Embiyax su, embarig su manu?</text><chinese>A:你好，你要買什麼?</chinese><lesson>10</lesson><season>1</season><order>3</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=10&amp;season=1</url></item><item><text>Embiyax namu kana, Hangan mu o Mowna.</text><chinese>A:大家好，我的名字是Mowna。</chinese><lesson>2</lesson><season>2</season><order>1</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=2&amp;season=2</url></item><item><text>Mowna embiyax su.</text><chinese>B:Mowna你好。</chinese><lesson>2</lesson><season>2</season><order>2</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=2&amp;season=2</url></item><item><text>Embiyax namu kana, Hangan mu o Samaw.</text><chinese>A:大家好，我的名字是Samaw。</chinese><lesson>2</lesson><season>2</season><order>3</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=2&amp;season=2</url></item><item><text>Samaw embiyax su.</text><chinese>B:Samaw你好。</chinese><lesson>2</lesson><season>2</season><order>4</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=2&amp;season=2</url></item><item><text>Embiyax su, Yaku o Mowna.</text><chinese>A:你好，我是Mowna。</chinese><lesson>2</lesson><season>2</season><order>5</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=2&amp;season=2</url></item><item><text>Mowna embiyax su, Yaku o Watan.</text><chinese>B:Mowna你好，我是Watan。</chinese><lesson>2</lesson><season>2</season><order>6</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=2&amp;season=2</url></item><item><text>Embiyax su, Yaku o Samaw.</text><chinese>A:你好，我是Samaw。</chinese><lesson>2</lesson><season>2</season><order>7</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=2&amp;season=2</url></item><item><text>Samaw embiyax su, Yaku o Watan.</text><chinese>B:Samaw你好，我是Watan。</chinese><lesson>2</lesson><season>2</season><order>8</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=2&amp;season=2</url></item><item><text>Embiyax su sbiyaw o manu ka qpahun su?</text><chinese>M:請問您年輕時是做什麼的?</chinese><lesson>9</lesson><season>2</season><order>15</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=9&amp;season=2</url></item><item><text>Embiyax su, piya pila ka kingal pajiq nii?</text><chinese>M:你好，請問這把菜多少錢?</chinese><lesson>10</lesson><season>2</season><order>22</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=10&amp;season=2</url></item><item><text>Kika Rudaw o, ini su qtai psiyaq da, embiyax su hug?</text><chinese>B:是Rudaw阿，很久沒有看到你了，你好嗎?</chinese><lesson>6</lesson><season>3</season><order>8</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=6&amp;season=3</url></item><item><text>Embiyax bi! Meyah ku miing pprngaw sunan.</text><chinese>A:很好啊!我來找你聊天。</chinese><lesson>6</lesson><season>3</season><order>9</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=6&amp;season=3</url></item><item><text>Embiyax su, mkmbarig ku butul ni muruq hiyi mqrig.</text><chinese>M:你好，我想要買糯米飯和山胡椒滷肉。</chinese><lesson>10</lesson><season>3</season><order>18</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=10&amp;season=3</url></item><count>24</count></dialogue><essay><item><text>Paru hnang nami rmngaw, “mtgsa, embiyax su hug.”</text><chinese>我們大聲的說:「老師好。」</chinese><lesson>1</lesson><season>1</season><order>3</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/essay/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=1&amp;season=1&amp;page=3</url></item><count>1</count></essay><readingtext><count>0</count></readingtext></dataroot>